    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Three ways to say «can»",
     "texto": [
      "**会** expresses a learned skill or something that will happen; **能** shows ability or possibility; **可以** expresses permission or possibility. In English we often use «can» for all three, so pay attention to what is meant."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
